    "application": "BambuStudio-02.05.00.66",
    "profile_title": "Flexi Snake with Hat - Arachne, Tuned Joints, 10% Gyroid",
    "profile_notes": "This profile is specifically configured for articulated models with small, repeating segments. It ensures each joint remains free-moving while capturing the fine details of the character's accessories. Wall Generator set to Arachne: This utilizes variable line widths to accurately print the tapered edges of the snake's body segments and the fine brim of the hat, ensuring no gaps appear in thin areas. Avoid Crossing Walls enabled: This restricts travel movements to the inside of the printed parts, preventing stringing between the segments that could otherwise fuse the joints together and ruin the articulation. Initial Layer Speed reduced : Articulated models consist of many small, separate islands on the first layer; slowing down ensures every piece has perfect bed adhesion to prevent segments from detaching during the print. 10% Gyroid Infill: This provides multi-directional strength for a part meant to be handled and flexed, while eliminating the nozzle-crossing vibrations common with the default grid pattern. Only one plate",
